    "Removed the legacy round-runtime bridge: round-bridge.ts and its index.ts hunks; herdr.ts restored to the installed npm file.",
    "pi driver: -e for each absolute path in IR_CHILD_EXTENSIONS and forwarding of variables listed in IR_CHILD_ENV (hostChildExtensions/hostChildEnv), because the pi-ir profile has no packages and Herdr panes do not inherit the parent env.",
    "config.json.example copied from the source package; tests copied to tests/memo-subagents with rewritten import paths; a test asserts that no agents are bundled (only global/project definitions)."
